{"ticker":{"symbol":"000320.KS","name":"노루홀딩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":14470.0,"change_pct":0.020451339915373845,"market_cap":152995807232.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0414651002073255,"week52_low":13450.0,"week52_high":28900.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"South Korea","city":"Anyang-Si","employees":58,"website":"https://www.norooholdings.com","business_summary":"NOROO Holdings Co., Ltd. operates as a general fine chemical company in South Korea. It produces industrial materials, such as paint, ink, resin, and coatings; and color chemicals used in automobiles and building interiors, as well as offers plastic products. The company is also involved in the distribution, processing, sale, and seed cultivation of agricultural products; investment; agricultural life related; seed production; and transportation intermediary agency and brokerage businesses. In addition, it offers color academy and consulting, trend show and seminar, and trend book businesses; manufactures and sells thinners; and operates logistics business. The company was formerly known as DPI Holdings Co., Ltd. and changed its name to NOROO Holdings Co., Ltd. in March 2010. NOROO Holdings Co., Ltd. was founded in 1945 and is headquartered in Anyang-Si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"노루홀딩스(주)는 대한민국의 종합정밀화학회사입니다. 페인트, 잉크, 수지, 코팅제 등 산업자재를 생산합니다. 자동차, 건물 인테리어 등에 사용되는 컬러케미컬, 플라스틱 제품 등을 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 농산물의 유통, 가공, 판매 및 종자 재배에도 참여하고 있습니다. 투자; 농업생활 관련; 종자 생산; 운송 중개업 및 중개업. 또한, 컬러 아카데미 및 컨설팅, 트렌드 쇼 및 세미나, 트렌드 북 사업 등을 제공하고 있습니다. 희석제 제조 및 판매; 물류사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 DPI홀딩스(주)로 알려졌으며 2010년 3월에 (주)노루홀딩스로 사명을 변경했습니다. 노루홀딩스(주)는 1945년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 안양시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"특수화학","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1031734916590.0